#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:2
msgid "Review Changes and Verification"
msgstr "审查变更和验证"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:4
msgid ""
"Treat every agent run as a change proposal with evidence. The "
"conversation timeline is the place to decide whether to continue, "
"approve, revise, or stop."
msgstr "将每次 agent 运行都视为一份带有证据的变更提案。你可以在对话时间线中决定是继续、批准、修改还是停止。"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:8
msgid "What to review"
msgstr "审查什么"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:10
msgid "Before accepting an implementation, inspect:"
msgstr "接受实现前，请检查："

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:12
msgid "the request and the workspace selected for the run;"
msgstr "请求以及运行所选的工作区；"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:13
msgid "tool names and inputs, especially commands and paths;"
msgstr "工具名称和输入，尤其是命令和路径；"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:14
msgid "file patches and inline diffs;"
msgstr "文件补丁和内联 diff；"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:15
msgid "Git diff and the list of changed files;"
msgstr "Git diff 和变更文件列表；"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:16
msgid "terminal output, warnings, and diagnostics;"
msgstr "终端输出、警告和诊断信息；"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:17
msgid "the verification status and the exact check that ran."
msgstr "验证状态以及实际运行的具体检查。"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:19
msgid ""
"A successful tool call is not the same as a correct feature. Compare the "
"actual diff with the requested outcome and run a project-specific test or"
" Godot check when the available validator is too broad or too weak."
msgstr "工具调用成功不等于功能正确。请将实际 diff 与请求的结果进行比较；当现有验证器范围过大或能力不足时，运行项目专属测试或 Godot 检查。"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:24
msgid "Godot changes"
msgstr "Godot 变更"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:26
msgid ""
"For editor-aware changes, the Bridge can expose typed inspection and "
"patch operations when the connected plugin advertises the required "
"capability. Patch proposals include normalized operations, summaries, "
"warnings, and a fingerprint. A stale fingerprint is rejected rather than "
"applied partially. Editor mutations are committed through Godot's "
"Undo/Redo transaction when the editor bridge supports the operation."
msgstr "对于编辑器感知的变更，当已连接插件声明所需能力时，Bridge 可以提供类型化检查和补丁操作。补丁提案包含规范化操作、摘要、警告和指纹。过期指纹会被拒绝，而不会部分应用。编辑器桥接支持相应操作时，编辑器变更会通过 Godot 的 Undo/Redo 事务提交。"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:34
msgid "If verification is missing"
msgstr "如果缺少验证"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:36
msgid ""
"Studio reports missing validation as a warning. A missing validator does "
"not mean the change passed. If an applicable validator fails, treat the "
"run as failed even when the agent provides a confident explanation."
msgstr "Studio 会将缺少验证报告为警告。没有验证器不代表变更通过。如果适用的验证器失败，即使 agent 给出了自信的解释，也应将本次运行视为失败。"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:41
msgid "Safe completion checklist"
msgstr "安全完成检查清单"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:43
msgid "Confirm the change is inside the intended workspace."
msgstr "确认变更位于预期工作区内。"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:44
msgid "Read the complete diff, not only the final summary."
msgstr "阅读完整 diff，而不只是最终摘要。"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:45
msgid ""
"Check that generated files, configuration, and unrelated formatting did "
"not change unexpectedly."
msgstr "检查生成文件、配置和无关格式是否发生了预期之外的变化。"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:47
msgid ""
"Read the verification output and reproduce the important check when the "
"result matters."
msgstr "阅读验证输出；结果重要时，重新执行关键检查。"

#: ../../source/agent/review.rst:49
msgid "Commit or save through your normal project workflow only after review."
msgstr "审查完成后，再通过平时的项目流程提交或保存。"
